ra-node node-industry\"><small>03</small><strong>INDUSTRY</strong></div><div class=\"mitra-node node-career\"><small>04</small><strong>CAREER</strong></div><div class=\"mitra-network-core\"><span>INFOKOM</span><strong>CONNECT</strong><i></i></div></div></div><div class=\"mitra-hero-bottom container reveal\"><span>SMK INFOKOM KOTA BOGOR</span><span class=\"mitra-scroll-line\"></span><a href=\"#network\">SCROLL ↓</a></div></section><section id=\"network\" class=\"mitra-intro\"><div class=\"container mitra-intro-grid\"><div class=\"mitra-section-label reveal\"><strong>02</strong><span>OUR NETWORK</span></div><div class=\"mitra-intro-copy reveal\"><p class=\"mitra-kicker mitra-kicker-dark\"><span></span>COLLABORATION</p><h2>MEMBANGUN HUBUNGAN DENGAN INDUSTRI.</h2><p>\n                    Jejaring industri menjadi bagian penting dalam mempertemukan pembelajaran\n                    vokasi dengan kebutuhan dunia kerja. Halaman ini menampilkan mitra yang\n                    menjadi bagian dari materi jejaring kerja sama yang diberikan.\n                </p><div class=\"mitra-rule\"><span></span></div></div></div></section><section id=\"partners\" class=\"mitra-partners\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mitra-bg-number\">03</div><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"mitra-heading reveal\"><div><p class=\"mitra-kicker mitra-kicker-dark\"><span></span>03 / INDUSTRY PARTNERS</p><h2>MITRA<br><em>KAMI.</em></h2></div><p class=\"mitra-heading-note\">\n                    Enam logo partner ditampilkan secara individual agar setiap identitas\n                    perusahaan memiliki ruang visual yang jelas dan kuat.\n                </p></div><div data-vb-dynamic=\"partners\" class=\"mitra-card-grid\"></div></div></section><section class=\"mitra-connected\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mitra-connected-grid\"></div><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"mitra-connected-head reveal\"><p class=\"mitra-kicker\"><span></span>04 / CONNECTED INDUSTRY</p><h2>FROM SCHOOL<br><em>TO INDUSTRY.</em></h2></div><div class=\"mitra-flow reveal\"><div class=\"mitra-flow-line\"></div><div class=\"mitra-flow-item\"><span>01</span><strong>SCHOOL</strong><small>Learn</small></div><div class=\"mitra-flow-item active\"><span>02</span><strong>BKK</strong><small>Connect</small></div><div class=\"mitra-flow-item\"><span>03</span><strong>INDUSTRY</strong><small>Collaborate</small></div><div class=\"mitra-flow-item\"><span>04</span><strong>CAREER</strong><small>Grow</small></div></div><div class=\"mitra-connected-tags reveal\"><span>EDUCATION</span><span>COLLABORATION</span><span>OPPORTUNITY</span><span>CAREER</span></div></div></section><section class=\"mitra-cta\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mitra-cta-word\">CONNECT</div><div class=\"container mitra-cta-inner reveal\"><p class=\"mitra-kicker\"><span></span>05 / COLLABORATION</p><h2>TERBUKA UNTUK<br><em>KOLABORASI INDUSTRI.</em></h2><p>Membangun hubungan yang relevan antara pendidikan vokasi dan dunia industri.</p><a href=\"/SMK-INFOKOM-KOTA-BOGOR1/kontak.php\" class=\"mitra-btn mitra-btn-primary\"><span>Hubungi Kami</span><strong>↗</strong></a></div></section></main><div id=\"mitraDrawer\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mitra-drawer\"><div data-mitra-close=\"\" class=\"mitra-drawer-backdrop\"></div><aside role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"mitraDrawerTitle\" class=\"mitra-drawer-panel\"><button type=\"button\" data-mitra-close=\"\" aria-label=\"Tutup\" class=\"mitra-drawer-close\">×</button><p class=\"mitra-kicker\"><span></span>PARTNER DETAIL</p><div class=\"mitra-drawer-logo\"><img id=\"mitraDrawerLogo\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"\"></div><span id=\"mitraDrawerIndex\" class=\"mitra-drawer-index\">01 / INDUSTRY</span><h2 id=\"mitraDrawerTitle\">—</h2><p id=\"mitraDrawerCategory\" class=\"mitra-drawer-category\">Mitra Industri</p><div class=\"mitra-drawer-rule\"></div><p id=\"mitraDrawerDescription\" class=\"mitra-drawer-description\">—</p><a id=\"mitraDrawerWebsite\" href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"mitra-btn mitra-btn-primary mitra-drawer-link\"><span>Kunjungi Website</span><strong>↗</strong></a></aside></div>', '', 1, '2026-10-21 04:09:06', NULL);
