INDUSTRY.</em></h2></div><div class=\"mitra-flow reveal\"><div class=\"mitra-flow-line\"></div><div class=\"mitra-flow-item\"><span>01</span><strong>SCHOOL</strong><small>Learn</small></div><div class=\"mitra-flow-item active\"><span>02</span><strong>BKK</strong><small>Connect</small></div><div class=\"mitra-flow-item\"><span>03</span><strong>INDUSTRY</strong><small>Collaborate</small></div><div class=\"mitra-flow-item\"><span>04</span><strong>CAREER</strong><small>Grow</small></div></div><div class=\"mitra-connected-tags reveal\"><span>EDUCATION</span><span>COLLABORATION</span><span>OPPORTUNITY</span><span>CAREER</span></div></div></section><section class=\"mitra-cta\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mitra-cta-word\">CONNECT</div><div class=\"container mitra-cta-inner reveal\"><p class=\"mitra-kicker\"><span></span>05 / COLLABORATION</p><h2>TERBUKA UNTUK<br><em>KOLABORASI INDUSTRI.</em></h2><p>Membangun hubungan yang relevan antara pendidikan vokasi dan dunia industri.</p><a href=\"/SMK-INFOKOM-KOTA-BOGOR1/kontak.php\" class=\"mitra-btn mitra-btn-primary\"><span>Hubungi Kami</span><strong>↗</strong></a></div></section></main><div id=\"mitraDrawer\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mitra-drawer\"><div data-mitra-close=\"\" class=\"mitra-drawer-backdrop\"></div><aside role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"mitraDrawerTitle\" class=\"mitra-drawer-panel\"><button type=\"button\" data-mitra-close=\"\" aria-label=\"Tutup\" class=\"mitra-drawer-close\">×</button><p class=\"mitra-kicker\"><span></span>PARTNER DETAIL</p><div class=\"mitra-drawer-logo\"><img id=\"mitraDrawerLogo\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"\"></div><span id=\"mitraDrawerIndex\" class=\"mitra-drawer-index\">01 / INDUSTRY</span><h2 id=\"mitraDrawerTitle\">—</h2><p id=\"mitraDrawerCategory\" class=\"mitra-drawer-category\">Mitra Industri</p><div class=\"mitra-drawer-rule\"></div><p id=\"mitraDrawerDescription\" class=\"mitra-drawer-description\">—</p><a id=\"mitraDrawerWebsite\" href