op\" class=\"pkl-hero\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pkl-grid-bg\" id=\"iy3e\"></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pkl-orbit pkl-orbit-one\"></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pkl-orbit pkl-orbit-two\"></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pkl-cross pkl-cross-a\"></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pkl-cross pkl-cross-b\"></div><div class=\"container pkl-hero-inner\"><div class=\"pkl-hero-copy reveal\" id=\"iiqcj\"><div class=\"pkl-kicker\"><span class=\"pkl-kicker-dot\"></span><span>01 / PRAKTIK KERJA LAPANGAN</span></div><h1 id=\"i3tte\">dari sekolah ke industri.</h1><p class=\"pkl-hero-lead\">\n                    Praktik Kerja Lapangan untuk menghubungkan pembelajaran di sekolah dengan pengalaman nyata di dunia kerja.                </p><div class=\"pkl-hero-actions\"><a href=\"#pkl-journey\" class=\"btn btn-primary pkl-btn\">\n                        Jelajahi PKL <span>↗</span></a><a href=\"#pkl-placement\" class=\"pkl-text-link\">\n                        Lihat Penempatan <span>↓</span></a></div></div><div aria-label=\"Alur Praktik Kerja Lapangan\" class=\"pkl-hero-visual reveal\"><div class=\"pkl-visual-label pkl-label-one\">SCHOOL</div><div class=\"pkl-visual-label pkl-label-two\">INDUSTRY</div><div class=\"pkl-visual-label pkl-label-three\">EXPERIENCE</div><div class=\"pkl-journey-core\"><div class=\"pkl-core-ring pkl-core-ring-one\"></div><div class=\"pkl-core-ring pkl-core-ring-two\"></div><div class=\"pkl-core-center\"><span>PKL</span><small>FIELD EXPERIENCE</small></div><div class=\"pkl-node pkl-node-one\"><b>01</b><span>SCHOOL</span></div><div class=\"pkl-node pkl-node-two\"><b>02</b><span>PREPARE</span></div><div class=\"pkl-node pkl-node-three\"><b>03</b><span>WORK</span></div><div class=\"pkl-node pkl-node-four\"><b>04</b><span>GROW</span></div><div class=\"pkl-path pkl-path-one\"></div><div class=\"pkl-path pkl-path-two\"></div><div class=\"pkl-path pkl-path-three\"></div><div class=\"pkl-path-dot\"></div></div><div class=\"pkl-hero-index\">PKL / 2026</div></div></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pkl-scroll-cue\"><span>SCROLL TO EXPLORE</span><i></i></div></section><section id=\"pkl-about\" class=\"pkl-about section\"><div class=\"container pkl-split\"><div class=\"pkl-section-heading reveal\"><p class=\"pkl-section-number\">02 / ABOUT PKL</p><h2>Belajar di sekolah.<br><em>Berpraktik di industri.</em></h2></div><div class=\"pkl-about-content reveal\"><p class=\"pkl-large-copy\">\n                    PKL menjadi ruang bagi siswa untuk membawa kompetensi yang dipelajari\n                    di sekolah ke dalam situasi kerja yang nyata.\n                </p><div class=\"pkl-about-rule\"><span></span></div><p>\n                    Melalui pengalaman langsung, siswa dapat mengenal ritme kerja,\n                    tanggung jawab, komunikasi, dan budaya profesional secara lebih dekat.\n                </p></div></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pkl-formula-wrap\"><div class=\"pkl-formula-item\">LEARN</div><div class=\"pkl-formula-plus\">+</div><div class=\"pkl-formula-item\">PRACTICE</div><div class=\"pkl-formula-plus\">+</div><div class=\"pkl-formula-item\">EXPERIENCE</div><div class=\"pkl-formula-equals\">=</div><div class=\"pkl-formula-result\">COMPETENCE</div></div></section><section id=\"pkl-goals\" class=\"pkl-goals section\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"pkl-section-intro reveal\"><p class=\"pkl-section-number\">03 / OBJECTIVES</p><h2>Pengalaman kerja<br><span>yang membentuk.</span></h2></div><div class=\"pkl-goal-list\"><article class=\"pkl-goal reveal\"><div class=\"pkl-goal-number\">01</div><div class=\"pkl-goal-copy\"><h3>MENGEMBANGKAN KOMPETENSI</h3><p>Menerapkan kompetensi keahlian melalui pengalaman kerja yang nyata.</p></div><span class=\"pkl-goal-arrow\">↗</span></article><article class=\"pkl-goal reveal\"><div class=\"pkl-goal-number\">02</div><div class=\"pkl-goal-copy\"><h3>MEMAHAMI DUNIA KERJA</h3><p>Mengenal budaya, ritme, tanggung jawab, dan lingkungan kerja profesional.</p></div><span class=\"pkl-goal-arrow\">↗</span></article><article class=\"pkl-goal reveal\"><div class=\"pkl-goal-number\">03</div><div class=\"pkl-goal-copy\"><h3>MEMBENTUK KARAKTER</h3><p>Membangun disiplin, komunikasi, tanggung jawab, dan etika profesional.</p></div><span class=\"pkl-goal-arrow\">↗</span></article><article class=\"pkl-goal reveal\"><div class=\"pkl-goal-number\">04</div><div class=\"pkl-goal-copy\"><h3>MENINGKATKAN KESIAPAN KERJA</h3><p>Menghubungkan pembelajaran di sekolah dengan kebutuhan dunia industri.</p></div><span class=\"pkl-goal-arrow\">↗</span></article></div></div></section><section id=\"pkl-journey\" class=\"pkl-journey section\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pkl-journey-bg-word\">JOURNEY</div><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"pkl-section-intro pkl-dark-intro reveal\"><p class=\"pkl-section-number\">04 / PKL JOURNEY</p><h2 id=\"iz4e5v\">Perjalanan dari<br><span>persiapan sampai evaluasi.</span></h2></div><div data-pkl-timeline=\"\" class=\"pkl-timeline\"><div class=\"pkl-timeline-track\"><span class=\"pkl-timeline-progress\"></span></div><article data-phase=\"\" class=\"pkl-phase reveal\"><div class=\"pkl-phase-dot\"><span>01</span></div><div class=\"pkl-phase-card\"><p>01 / PKL</p><h3 id=\"ib1viz\">PEMBEKALAN</h3><span class=\"pkl-phase-line\"></span><div class=\"pkl-phase-description\">Siswa mempersiapkan kompetensi, sikap kerja, dan pemahaman sebelum memasuki lingkungan industri.</div></div></article><article data-phase=\"\" class=\"pkl-phase reveal\"><div class=\"pkl-phase-dot\"><span>02</span></div><div class=\"pkl-phase-card\"><p>02 / PKL</p><h3 id=\"iuhsmz\">PENEMPATAN</h3><span class=\"pkl-phase-line\"></span><div class=\"pkl-phase-description\">Penempatan siswa disesuaikan dengan program keahlian dan kebutuhan tempat pelaksanaan PKL.</div></div></article><article data-phase=\"\" class=\"pkl-phase reveal\"><div class=\"pkl-phase-dot\"><span>03</span></div><div class=\"pkl-phase-card\"><p>03 / PKL</p><h3 id=\"ippe8f\">PELAKSANAAN</h3><span class=\"pkl-phase-line\"></span><div class=\"pkl-phase-description\">Siswa menerapkan kompetensi sekolah melalui pengalaman kerja secara langsung.</div></div></article><article data-phase=\"\" class=\"pkl-phase reveal\"><div class=\"pkl-phase-dot\"><span>04</span></div><div class=\"pkl-phase-card\"><p>04 / PKL</p><h3 id=\"i8uht2\">MONITORING</h3><span class=\"pkl-phase-line\"></span><div class=\"pkl-phase-description\">Perkembangan siswa dipantau melalui hubungan antara siswa, pembimbing sekolah, dan pembimbing industri.</div></div></article><article data-phase=\"\" class=\"pkl-phase reveal\"><div class=\"pkl-phase-dot\"><span>05</span></div><div class=\"pkl-phase-card\"><p>05 / PKL</p><h3 id=\"izi5bh\">EVALUASI</h3><span class=\"pkl-phase-line\"></span><div class=\"pkl-phase-description\">Pengalaman dan hasil pelaksanaan PKL menjadi bagian dari proses evaluasi dan pengembangan kompetensi.</div></div></article></div></div></section><section id=\"pkl-placement\" class=\"pkl-placement section\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"pkl-placement-head reveal\"><div><p class=\"pkl-section-number\">05 / STUDENT PLACEMENT</p><h2>Penempatan<br><span>PKL.</span></h2></div><div class=\"pkl-placement-note\"><span class=\"pkl-live-dot\"></span><p>Data penempatan dapat dikelola melalui dashboard admin.</p></div></div><div role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Filter program PKL\" class=\"pkl-filter reveal\"><button type=\"button\" data-pkl-filter=\"all\" class=\"is-active\">SEMUA</button><button type=\"button\" data-pkl-filter=\"rpl\">RPL</button><button type=\"button\" data-pkl-filter=\"tjkt\">TJKT</button><button type=\"button\" data-pkl-filter=\"dkv\">DKV</button><button type=\"button\" data-pkl-filter=\"pspt\">PSPT</button></div><div data-pkl-placement-grid=\"\" data-vb-dynamic=\"placements\" class=\"pkl-placement-grid\"></div></div></section><section id=\"pkl-connection\" class=\"pkl-connection section\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"pkl-connection-shell reveal\"><div class=\"pkl-connection-copy\"><p class=\"pkl-section-number\">06 / INDUSTRY CONNECTION</p><h2 id=\"ixe69b\">School.<br>Student.<br><span>Industry.</span></h2><p>\n                        PKL mempertemukan kompetensi sekolah dengan pengalaman kerja melalui\n                        proses yang terarah dan terhubung.\n                    </p></div><div aria-label=\"Alur koneksi PKL: School, Student, Industry\" class=\"pkl-connection-map\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pkl-connection-rail\"><span class=\"pkl-rail-segment segment-one\"></span><span class=\"pkl-rail-segment segment-two\"></span><span class=\"pkl-rail-dot\"></span></div><div class=\"pkl-connect-node node-school\"><b>01</b><strong>SCHOOL</strong><span>COMPETENCY</span></div><div class=\"pkl-connect-node node-student\"><b>02</b><strong>STUDENT</strong><span>EXPERIENCE</span></div><div class=\"pkl-connect-node node-industry\"><b>03</b><strong>INDUSTRY</strong><span>WORKPLACE</span></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"pkl-monitoring section\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"pkl-monitoring-layout\"><div class=\"pkl-section-heading reveal\"><p class=\"pkl-section-number\">07 / MONITORING</p><h2>Terhubung.<br><em>Terpantau.</em><br>Terarah.</h2></div><div class=\"pkl-monitoring-stack reveal\"><div class=\"pkl-monitor-card\"><span>01</span><strong>PEMBIMBING SEKOLAH</strong><i>↗</i></div><div class=\"pkl-monitor-connector\"></div><div class=\"pkl-monitor-card is-main\"><span>02</span><strong>SISWA</strong><i>↗</i></div><div class=\"pkl-monitor-connector\"></div><div class=\"pkl-monitor-card\"><span>03</span><strong>PEMBIMBING INDUSTRI</strong><i>↗</i></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"pkl-faq\" class=\"pkl-faq section\"><div class=\"container pkl-faq-layout\"><div class=\"pkl-section-intro reveal\"><p class=\"pkl-section-number\">08 / FAQ</p><h2>Pertanyaan<br><span>seputar PKL.</span></h2></div><div class=\"pkl-accordion reveal\"><details open=\"\"><summary><span>01</span> Apa itu Praktik Kerja Lapangan?</summary><div class=\"pkl-answer\">PKL merupakan pengalaman belajar di lingkungan kerja yang membantu siswa menerapkan kompetensi dan mengenal budaya profesional.</div></details><details><summary><span>02</span> Bagaimana proses penempatan PKL?</summary><div class=\"pkl-answer\">Penempatan mengikuti proses dan kebijakan sekolah serta mempertimbangkan program keahlian dan kebutuhan tempat pelaksanaan.</div></details><details><summary><span>03</span> Apakah siswa mendapatkan monitoring?</summary><div class=\"pkl-answer\">Monitoring menjadi bagian dari proses PKL melalui keterhubungan siswa, pembimbing sekolah, dan pembimbing industri.</div></details><details><summary><span>04</span> Bagaimana hasil PKL dievaluasi?</summary><div class=\"pkl-answer\">Evaluasi dilakukan sebagai bagian dari peninjauan pengalaman dan perkembangan kompetensi siswa selama pelaksanaan PKL.</div></details></div></div></section><section class=\"pkl-cta\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pkl-cta-grid\"></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pkl-cta-shape\"></div><div class=\"container pkl-cta-inner reveal\"><p class=\"pkl-section-number\">09 / YOUR EXPERIENCE</p><h2 id=\"ix23og\">SIAP MENGENAL<br><span id=\"iz809t\">DUNIA KERJA?</span></h2><p>Bangun pengalaman, kembangkan kompetensi, dan bersiap menghadapi dunia industri.</p><a href=\"#pkl-journey\" class=\"btn btn-primary pkl-btn\">Lihat Alur PKL <span>↗</span></a></div></section></main>', '#i8uht2{color:white;}#iz4e5v{color:white;}#ib1viz{color:white;}#iuhsmz{color:white;}#ippe8f{color:white;}#izi5bh{color:white;}#ixe69b{color:white;}#ix23og{color:white;}', 1, '2026-10-21 04:25:50', NULL);
