dden=\"true\" class=\"contact-grid-bg\"></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"contact-hero-orbit orbit-a\"></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"contact-hero-orbit orbit-b\"></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"contact-hero-line line-a\"></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"contact-hero-line line-b\"></div><div class=\"container contact-hero-inner\"><div class=\"contact-hero-copy reveal\"><p class=\"contact-kicker\"><span>01</span> / KONTAK</p><h1>MARI TERHUBUNG.</h1><p class=\"contact-hero-text\">\n                Temukan lokasi, hubungi kami, dan dapatkan informasi yang kamu butuhkan tentang SMK Infokom Kota Bogor.            </p><div data-vb-dynamic=\"contact-actions-hero\" class=\"contact-actions\"></div></div><div aria-label=\"Visual lokasi SMK Infokom Kota Bogor\" class=\"contact-location-visual reveal\"><div class=\"location-coordinates\"> / </div><div class=\"location-status\"><span></span> LOKASI AKTIF</div><div class=\"location-orbit location-orbit-one\"></div><div class=\"location-orbit location-orbit-two\"></div><div class=\"location-cross cross-one\"></div><div class=\"location-cross cross-two\"></div><div class=\"location-pin-wrap\"><div class=\"location-ripple\"></div><div class=\"location-pin\"><span></span></div></div><div class=\"location-label\"><small>SMK INFOKOM</small><strong>KOTA BOGOR</strong><span>JAWA BARAT · INDONESIA</span></div><div class=\"location-tag tag-one\">SEKOLAH</div><div class=\"location-tag tag-two\">BOGOR</div><div class=\"location-tag tag-three\">PETA / 01</div></div></div></section><section class=\"contact-section contact-find\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"contact-section-head reveal\"><p class=\"contact-kicker dark\"><span>02</span> / TEMUKAN KAMI</p><h2>Temukan lokasi kami.<br><strong>Mulai percakapan.</strong></h2></div><div data-vb-dynamic=\"contact-find\" class=\"contact-find-grid contact-find-grid-premium\"></div></div></section><section class=\"contact-section contact-channels contact-channels-redesign\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"contact-section-head reveal\"><p class=\"contact-kicker dark\"><span>03</span> / SALURAN KONTAK</p><h2>Pilih<br><strong>cara untuk terhubung.</strong></h2><p class=\"contact-channels-intro\">Pilih cara yang paling nyaman untuk menghubungi tim SMK Infokom Kota Bogor.</p></div><div class=\"contact-connect-layout\"><div data-vb-dynamic=\"contact-channels\" class=\"contact-connect-cards\"></div>            <div aria-label=\"Ilustrasi tiga dimensi smartphone dan gelembung pesan\" class=\"contact-connect-visual reveal\"><div class=\"connect-visual-glow\"></div><div class=\"connect-orbit connect-orbit-one\"></div><div class=\"connect-orbit connect-orbit-two\"></div><div class=\"connect-floating-bubble bubble-message\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div><div class=\"connect-floating-bubble bubble-mail\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"5\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"m4 7 8 6 8-6\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"connect-phone-shadow\"></div><div class=\"connect-phone\"><div class=\"connect-phone-side\"></div><div class=\"connect-phone-screen\"><div class=\"connect-phone-notch\"></div><div class=\"connect-screen-top\"><span>09:41</span><span>● ● ▰</span></div><div class=\"connect-screen-avatar\">I</div><strong>Infokom Humas</strong><small>aktif</small><div class=\"connect-chat chat-in\">Halo! Ada yang bisa kami bantu?</div><div class=\"connect-chat chat-out\">Saya ingin bertanya.</div><div class=\"connect-chat chat-in short\"></div><div class=\"connect-screen-input\"><span>Pesan...</span><b>➤</b></div></div></div><div class=\"connect-floating-bubble bubble-check\">✓</div><span class=\"connect-visual-caption\">MARI BERBICARA <i></i> KAMI SIAP MEMBANTU</span></div></div></div></section><section aria-labelledby=\"contact-hours-title\" class=\"contact-section contact-hours contact-hours-premium\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"contact-hours-glow contact-hours-glow-one\"></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"contact-hours-glow contact-hours-glow-two\"></div><div class=\"container contact-hours-container\"><div class=\"contact-hours-editorial reveal\"><p class=\"contact-kicker dark\"><span>05</span> / JAM OPERASIONAL</p><h2 id=\"contact-hours-title\">Ketahui<br><strong>kapan kami tersedia.</strong></h2><p class=\"contact-hours-intro\">Rencanakan kunjungan sesuai jam operasional sekolah. Kami menantikan kedatangan Anda.</p><div class=\"contact-hours-note\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"contact-hours-note-dot\"></span><span>Semua waktu menggunakan Waktu Indonesia Barat (WIB).</span></div></div><div class=\"contact-hours-dashboard reveal\"><div class=\"contact-clock-card\"><div class=\"contact-clock-topline\"><span><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> WAKTU SETEMPAT</span><span>WIB · UTC+7</span></div><time id=\"contactLiveClock\" datetime=\"\" class=\"contact-live-clock\">--:--:--</time><div class=\"contact-clock-bottom\"><span id=\"contactLiveDay\">Memuat hari…</span><span id=\"contactLiveDate\">Memuat tanggal…</span></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"contact-clock-orbit\"><span></span></div></div><div class=\"contact-hours-schedule\"><div class=\"contact-hours-schedule-head\"><div><span class=\"contact-schedule-index\">JADWAL / 01</span><h3>Jadwal operasional</h3></div><span class=\"contact-schedule-badge\">MINGGUAN</span></div><div data-vb-dynamic=\"contact-hours\" class=\"contact-hours-timeline\"></div>                <p class=\"contact-hours-footnote\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">✳</span> Hari libur nasional mengikuti kalender resmi hari libur.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"contact-section contact-faq\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"contact-section-head reveal\"><p class=\"contact-kicker dark\"><span>06</span> / PERTANYAAN UMUM</p><h2>Pertanyaan,<br><strong>terjawab.</strong></h2></div><div class=\"contact-faq-list\"><details class=\"contact-faq-item reveal\"><summary><span>01</span> Bagaimana cara menuju SMK Infokom?</summary><p>Gunakan tombol Google Maps pada halaman ini untuk membuka lokasi sekolah langsung di Google Maps.</p></details><details class=\"contact-faq-item reveal\"><summary><span>02</span> Bagaimana cara menghubungi sekolah?</summary><p>Kamu dapat menghubungi sekolah melalui telepon, WhatsApp, email, atau formulir kontak yang tersedia.</p></details><details class=\"contact-faq-item reveal\"><summary><span>03</span> Apakah sekolah dapat dihubungi melalui WhatsApp?</summary><p>Ya. Tombol WhatsApp akan membuka percakapan langsung dengan nomor WhatsApp yang dikelola dari pengaturan website.</p></details><details class=\"contact-faq-item reveal\"><summary><span>04</span> Di mana lokasi sekolah?</summary><p>Lokasi sekolah ditampilkan pada peta Google Maps di bagian Temukan Kami dan mengikuti data lokasi dari pengaturan website.</p></details></div></div></section><section class=\"contact-final-cta\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"contact-cta-word\">KONTAK</div><div class=\"container contact-cta-inner reveal\"><p class=\"contact-kicker\"><span>07</span> / HUBUNGI KAMI</p><h2 id=\"i8fxe9\">BUTUH LEBIH BANYAK<br><strong>INFORMASI?</strong></h2><p>Kami siap membantu.</p><div data-vb-dynamic=\"contact-actions\" class=\"contact-actions\"></div></div></section>', '#i8fxe9{color:white;}', 1, '2026-10-21 06:32:21', NULL);
