l></div><span class=\"ekskul-stage-node node-1\">01</span><span class=\"ekskul-stage-node node-2\">02</span><span class=\"ekskul-stage-node node-3\">03</span><span class=\"ekskul-stage-node node-4\">04</span><span class=\"ekskul-stage-node node-5\">05</span><span class=\"ekskul-stage-node node-6\">06</span></div></div></section><section class=\"ekskul-intro section\" id=\"iql2y\"><div class=\"container ekskul-section-head reveal\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">02 / EXPLORE ACTIVITIES</p><h2>ENAM RUANG.<br><span>SATU PERJALANAN.</span></h2></div><p>\n                Setiap kegiatan menjadi ruang untuk mencoba, berlatih, berkolaborasi,\n                dan tumbuh bersama.\n            </p></div><div id=\"activities\" data-vb-dynamic=\"activities\" class=\"container ekskul-list\"></div></section><section class=\"ekskul-growth section\"><div class=\"ekskul-growth-bg\">GROW</div><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"ekskul-section-head ekskul-growth-head reveal\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">03 / SIX WAYS TO GROW</p><h2 id=\"iwrdd5\">BUILD SKILLS<br><span>BEYOND THE CLASSROOM.</span></h2></div></div><div class=\"ekskul-growth-grid\"><div class=\"ekskul-growth-card reveal\"><span>01</span><div><small>DISCIPLINE</small><strong>PASKIBRA</strong></div><i></i></div><div class=\"ekskul-growth-card reveal\"><span>02</span><div><small>INDEPENDENCE</small><strong>PRAMUKA</strong></div><i></i></div><div class=\"ekskul-growth-card reveal\"><span>03</span><div><small>CARE</small><strong>PMR</strong></div><i></i></div><div class=\"ekskul-growth-card reveal\"><span>04</span><div><small>CULTURE</small><strong>JAPAN INDONESIA COMMUNITY</strong></div><i></i></div><div class=\"ekskul-growth-card reveal\"><span>05</span><div><small>TEAMWORK</small><strong>FUTSAL</strong></div><i></i></div><div class=\"ekskul-growth-card reveal\"><span>06</span><div><small>CREATIVITY</small><strong>HADROH</strong></div><i></i></div></div></div></section><section class=\"ekskul-journey section\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"ekskul-section-head reveal\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">04 / ACTIVITY JOURNEY</p><h2>DISCOVER.<br>JOIN. <span>GROW.</span></h2></div><p>\n                    Mulai dari rasa ingin tahu, temukan komunitas yang cocok, lalu berkembang\n                    melalui pengalaman bersama.\n                </p></div><div class=\"ekskul-journey-track\"><div class=\"ekskul-journey-progress\"></div><div class=\"ekskul-journey-step reveal\"><span class=\"ekskul-journey-node\">01</span><div><small>STEP 01</small><h3>DISCOVER</h3><p>Temukan kegiatan yang paling dekat dengan minatmu.</p></div></div><div class=\"ekskul-journey-step reveal\"><span class=\"ekskul-journey-node\">02</span><div><small>STEP 02</small><h3>JOIN</h3><p>Bergabung dan kenali lingkungan komunitasnya.</p></div></div><div class=\"ekskul-journey-step reveal\"><span class=\"ekskul-journey-node\">03</span><div><small>STEP 03</small><h3>PRACTICE</h3><p>Latih kemampuan melalui kegiatan bersama.</p></div></div><div class=\"ekskul-journey-step reveal\"><span class=\"ekskul-journey-node\">04</span><div><small>STEP 04</small><h3>GROW</h3><p>Bangun pengalaman, karakter, dan kepercayaan diri.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section aria-labelledby=\"ekskul-cta-title\" class=\"ekskul-cta\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ekskul-cta-lines\"></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ekskul-cta-orbit ekskul-cta-orbit-one\"></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ekskul-cta-orbit ekskul-cta-orbit-two\"></div><div class=\"container ekskul-cta-inner reveal\"><p class=\"eyebrow ekskul-cta-eyebrow\">05 / YOUR SPACE</p><h2 id=\"ekskul-cta-title\"><span class=\"ekskul-cta-line\">YOUR INTEREST</span><span class=\"ekskul-cta-line\">CAN BECOME</span><span class=\"ekskul-cta-line ekskul-cta-highlight\">YOUR STRENGTH.</span></h2><p class=\"ekskul-cta-description\">Explore your interests. Build your potential.</p><a href=\"#activities\" class=\"ekskul-cta-button\"><span>Explore Activities</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ekskul-cta-button-icon\">↗</span></a></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ekskul-cta-word\">EXPLORE</div></section></main>', '#iwrdd5{color:white;}', 1, '2026-10-21 15:20:06', NULL);
