SIA</span><span class=\"magang-map-label label-prep\">PREPARATION</span><span class=\"magang-map-label label-jp\">JAPAN</span><span class=\"magang-map-label label-career\">EXPERIENCE</span><span class=\"magang-route magang-route-a\"></span><span class=\"magang-route magang-route-b\"></span><span class=\"magang-route-dot\"></span><span class=\"magang-route-dot second\"></span><div class=\"magang-japan-mark\">日</div></div></div></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"magang-scroll-cue\"><span>SCROLL TO EXPLORE</span><i></i></div></section><section class=\"section magang-intro-section\"><div class=\"container magang-intro-grid\"><div class=\"reveal\"><p class=\"magang-section-kicker\">02 / JAPAN INTERNSHIP</p><h2>Belajar di kelas. Berkembang di dunia nyata.</h2></div><div class=\"magang-intro-copy reveal\"><p>\n                Program Magang Jepang menjadi ruang untuk mengenal budaya kerja, membangun kemandirian,\n                dan mendapatkan pengalaman profesional dalam lingkungan internasional.\n            </p><div class=\"magang-mini-line\"><span></span><b>INTERNATIONAL EXPERIENCE</b></div></div></div></section><section id=\"japan-journey\" class=\"magang-benefit-section\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"magang-section-heading reveal\"><div><p class=\"magang-section-kicker\">03 / WHY JAPAN</p><h2>Lebih dari sekadar<br><strong>pengalaman kerja.</strong></h2></div><span class=\"magang-heading-number\">JPN / 03</span></div><div class=\"magang-benefit-grid\"><article class=\"magang-benefit-card magang-accent-yellow reveal\"><span class=\"benefit-number\">01</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"benefit-symbol\">↗</span><div><p>WORK CULTURE</p><h3 id=\"ij5ep\">Mengenal disiplin, ketelitian, dan budaya profesional Jepang.</h3></div><span class=\"benefit-line\"></span></article><article class=\"magang-benefit-card magang-accent-blue reveal\"><span class=\"benefit-number\">02</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"benefit-symbol\">↗</span><div><p>LANGUAGE</p><h3 id=\"i4y3pq\">Mengembangkan kemampuan komunikasi dan penggunaan bahasa Jepang.</h3></div><span class=\"benefit-line\"></span></article><article class=\"magang-benefit-card magang-accent-yellow reveal\"><span class=\"benefit-number\">03</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"benefit-symbol\">↗</span><div><p>REAL EXPERIENCE</p><h3 id=\"ismcwt\">Belajar melalui pengalaman langsung dalam lingkungan kerja.</h3></div><span class=\"benefit-line\"></span></article><article class=\"magang-benefit-card magang-accent-blue reveal\"><span class=\"benefit-number\">04</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"benefit-symbol\">↗</span><div><p>GLOBAL EXPOSURE</p><h3 id=\"ism2zn\">Membuka wawasan terhadap lingkungan dan cara kerja internasional.</h3></div><span class=\"benefit-line\"></span></article></div></div></section><section class=\"magang-process-section\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"magang-section-heading light reveal\"><div><p class=\"magang-section-kicker\">04 / PREPARATION</p><h2>Menuju Jepang,<br><strong>selangkah demi selangkah.</strong></h2></div></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"magang-process-line\"><span></span></div><div class=\"magang-process-grid\"><article class=\"magang-step reveal\"><span>01</span><h3>PERSIAPAN</h3><p>Membangun kesiapan awal program.</p><i></i></article><article class=\"magang-step reveal\"><span>02</span><h3>BAHASA JEPANG</h3><p>Mempersiapkan komunikasi dan pemahaman bahasa.</p><i></i></article><article class=\"magang-step reveal\"><span>03</span><h3>PEMBEKALAN</h3><p>Mengenal budaya dan lingkungan kerja.</p><i></i></article><article class=\"magang-step reveal\"><span>04</span><h3>SELEKSI</h3><p>Mengikuti proses seleksi program.</p><i></i></article><article class=\"magang-step reveal\"><span>05</span><h3>KEBERANGKATAN</h3><p>Mempersiapkan perjalanan menuju Jepang.</p><i></i></article><article class=\"magang-step reveal\"><span>06</span><h3>MAGANG DI JEPANG</h3><p>Mendapatkan pengalaman langsung di lingkungan kerja.</p><i><